\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Denmark hikes main rate to keep crown in tight range vs euro\b0\par\par\uc2 750 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 2016\par 17:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds analyst, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  move, context)\par \par \uc2 By Sabina Zawadzki\par \par \uc2 COPENHAGEN, Jan 7 (Reuters) - \uc2 Denmark's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its main interest rate on Thursday to keep its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a tight range against the euro, in a rare step taken independently of action by the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with which it usually moves in lockstep.\par \par \uc2 In its first move since last February, the bank raised its certificate of deposit rate to minus 0.65 percent from minus 0.75 percent. It left its lending and discount rates at 0.05 percent and 0.00 percent, respectively.\par \par \uc2 It uses the deposit rate, the return banks get for parking money with it for one week, as one way to maintain the Danish crown's long-held peg to the euro. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also frequently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.\par \par \uc2 Thursday's move follows nine consecutive months of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bolster the crown as well as \b \highlight22\uc2 Denmark\b0 \highlight\uc2  failing to act when \uc2 the ECB\uc2  cut rates on Dec. 3.\par \par \uc2 The rate hike is also out of step with neighbouring Sweden, which has been battling flat or falling consumer prices and said earlier this week it was ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets despite the fact that the Swedish crown floats freely.\par \par \uc2 The Danish crown has traded around 7.4610 per euro in recent days, close to its central parity rate of 7.46038, although it strengthened to a two-month high at 7.4575 following the rate decision.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no fixed schedule of meetings and never gives guidance on monetary policy. But many analysts had expected Thursday's move in view of the amounts the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has spent on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Whether today's rate hike will be followed by further rate hikes will depend entirely on the future development of the Danish crown against the euro. In our main scenario we do not expect that further rate increases will be required on this side of summer," said Nordea's chief analyst, Jan Storup Nielsen.\par \par \uc2 DENMARK WINS 'CROWN WAR'\par \par \uc2 Denmark began diverging from \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  actions at the start of last year when the crown came under huge upward pressure from investors believing the country would drop the euro peg, days after Switzerland scrapped its cap on the franc against the shared \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 That pressure eased after four rate cuts in January and February, massive \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other moves such as the suspension of government bond issues. On April 2 the crown hit its weakest point against the euro in 14 years.\par \par \uc2 Since then, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has gradually depleted its foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves as it fights the weakness of the crown through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Today's interest rate announcement is yet another sign that the crown war has found its final closure," said Christian Heinig, chief economist at \uc2 Realkredit Danmark\uc2 , referring to the pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the wake of Switzerland's move.\par \par \uc2 "A closure was already indicated in 2015 as \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves declined, and it became even more evident in December when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not copy the interest rate cut from the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said.\par \par \uc2 Data issued on Tuesday showed the bank's reserves fell by almost 50 billion crowns in December, the largest drop since \uc2 Lehman Brothers\uc2  collapsed in 2008.\par \par \uc2 Its reserves are now lower than at the end of 2014, when the crown began to strengthen causing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to pump crowns into the market by buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , thus building the reserves to record highs.\par \par \uc2 Reserves fell by 49 billion crowns to 434.9 billion crowns ($62.7 billion) in December from 483.9 billion crowns at the end of November having peaked at 737 billion crowns last March.\par \par \uc2 Under the \uc2 European Union\uc2 's Exchange Rate Mechanism (ERM2), Denmark, an \uc2 EU\uc2  member but euro zone outsider, has agreed to keep the crown within 2.25 percent of the parity rate of 7.46038 crowns to the euro. In practice, the crown has not moved more than 0.5 percent either side of that rate.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  head \uc2 Lars Rohde\uc2  can now be euphoric after the victory. The war on the crown, which raged in the beginning of 2015, is now over with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a clear winner," \uc2 Sydbank\uc2 's chief economist, Jacob Graven, said. (Additional reporting by Teis Jensen and Annabela Nielsen, editing by Hugh Lawson) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-1-7T17:33:23.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160107ec1700inb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
