\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-\uc2 Danish  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  chief says market counting on rate hike\b0\par\par\uc2 542 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 2015\par 15:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Releads on rate expectations, adds cbank governor comments)\par \par \uc2 By \uc2 Ole Mikkelsen\par \par \uc2 COPENHAGEN, Sept 16 (Reuters) - \uc2 Danish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor \uc2 Lars Rohde\uc2  said on Wednesday the money markets appear to be pricing in an interest rate hike, but he declined to say when and by how much the bank will lift its main rate.\par \par \uc2 The spread in the money market for one-month interest rates between Denmark and the euro zone has narrowed to -0.2 percentage points from -0.8 points in February, showing that investors expect Danish rates to be closer to their ECB peers.\par \par \uc2 Denmark's benchmark, the certificate of deposit rate, has been at -0.75 percent, compared with \uc2 the ECB\uc2 's deposit rate of -0.2 percent, since February after four cuts in less than two months when the crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  came under heavy pressure to strengthen.\par \par \uc2 "The negative spread to the euro area in the Danish money market has become smaller. One could interpret it as the market's expectation for gradual increases in interest rates," Rohde told reporters.\par \par \uc2 Some Danish analysts expect a rate hike could come at any time while others see a rise or two by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Speculators poured money into Danish assets at the start of the year, betting Denmark would drop its three-decade-old \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg, following a move by the Swiss \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to scrap its cap on the franc against the euro.\par \par \uc2 That pressure lead \b \highlight22\uc2 Denmark\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cut interest rates, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and suspend government debt issuance in a bid to relieve demand for the crown.\par \par \uc2 The government plans to resume bond issuance as of October, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would not hesitate to suspend issuance again if need be.\par \par \uc2 "We have plenty of tools to achieve the objective of keeping the crown stable," Rohde told Reuters after the bank issued its quarterly economic forecasts.\par \par \uc2 ECONOMIC UPSWING\par \par \uc2 The bank trimmed its forecast for economic growth in 2015 but said overall the country was heading for an upswing and the government should move away from fiscal stimulus policies.\par \par \uc2 It expected the economy to grow 1.8 percent this year, lower than its previous forecast of 2.0 percent, mainly because of lower exports and private consumption earlier this year. It kept its 2016 forecast at 2.1 percent.\par \par \uc2 It said Denmark's growth potential is between 1.0 percent and 1.3 percent per year with a steady workforce and the country needed more in employment to reach stronger growth rates such the forecasted 1.8 percent for this year. The labour markets has improved with an increasing work force in 26 consecutive months.\par \par \uc2 Denmark's economy is largely export-driven, so it depends on the fortunes of neighbours such as Germany and Sweden, the largest buyers of its goods.\par \par \uc2 A new centre-right government has been in place since July and promised to freeze state spending at current levels, although it relies on support in parliament of the populist Danish People's Party, who advocate more spending. (Additional reporting by Teis Jensen; Editing by Sabina Zawadzki and Hugh Lawson) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-9-16T14:17:28.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150916eb9g00caa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
