\par\par \b \uc2 *Denmark  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Reserves Increased By DKK172.9B To DKK737.1B In Feb\b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2015\par 16:09\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 3 Mar 2015 10:10 ET *Denmark Ctrl Bk: Net Purchases of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Amounted To DKK168.7B In Feb\par \par \uc2 3 Mar 2015 10:43 ET  Denmark \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Reserves Increased by DKK172.9B to DKK737.1B in Feb\par \par \uc2 By Emese Bartha\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Denmark\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in February, in line with its long-running efforts to prevent the krone from climbing too high and to maintain its fixed exchange rate with the euro.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's net purchase of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  via \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market amounted to 168.7 billion Danish kronor ($25.31 billion), it said, adding that the main part of the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  took place during the days around the interest rate reduction on Feb. 5. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves increased by DKK172.9 billion to DKK737.1 billion in February.\par \par \uc2 Denmark has cut its key policy rates four times this year, with the certificate of deposit rate last reduced by 0.25 percentage point to -0.75%. In other measures aimed at deflecting foreign inflows, it has suspended government bond issuance until further notice and rejected bids at some recent treasury bill auctions.\par \par \uc2 The Danish krone was recently trading at 7.4530 to the euro.\par \par \uc2 --Anna Molin in Stockholm contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 March 03, 2015 10:43 ET (15:43 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150303eb33002dn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
